Vendored UI icons — Lucide (https://lucide.dev, https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide)

These SVGs are copied unmodified from the Lucide icon set and bundled here so the
plugin ships fully offline (no CDN, no npm/build step — see CLAUDE.md coding
standard #3). Lucide is ISC-licensed; some glyphs derive from Feather (MIT). The
full upstream license text is vendored alongside as ./LICENSE.

The frontend does NOT load these files at runtime. Their path bodies are inlined
verbatim into the `Icons` static class (static/netbox_facilitymap/lib.js), which
returns each glyph as an SVG string on Lucide's native 24×24 viewBox. These files
are the auditable source of truth for those inlined paths — regenerate the getter
after replacing an icon here. Keep this map in sync with `Icons`:

